syauth (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add Nix packaging and declarative NixOS integration.
  * Derive and validate the selected desktop account's PAM socket.
  * Preserve daemon ownership of newly created PAM audit logs.
  * Exercise installed PAM and configuration rollback in a NixOS VM in CI.

